# EC-011: Different current–time pairs deliver the same electrolysis charge
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 Na2SO4 0.001mol
seal v1 100mL
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 Na2SO4 0.001mol
seal v2 100mL
electrolyse v1 0.05A 100s
electrolyse v2 0.1A 50s
inspect
